OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fcloudy with showery rain, mostly in
OL,7,Fthe north. Drier with clear spells
OL,8,Fsouth. Becoming mostly dry and frosty
OL,9,Fwith clear spells after midnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FMostly dry and bright but
OL,12,Fblustery, locally heavy and wintry
OL,13,Fshowers spread south from the late
OL,14,Fafternoon.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FCold
OL,17,Fwith blustery and wintry showers
OL,18,FThursday. Less cold and mostly dry but
OL,19,Fcloudy Friday and Saturday.
